{
  "$schema": "/scene-schema.json",
  "id": "design-hashmap",
  "title": "Design HashMap from Scratch",
  "type": "lld",
  "layout": "text-left-canvas-right",
  "description": "Build a HashMap from scratch: hash function, collision handling via chaining, and dynamic resizing. Understand why average O(1) get/put is possible.",
  "category": "Low Level Design",
  "canvas": [
    {
      "id": "bucket-array",
      "type": "linear",
      "variant": "array",
      "layoutHint": "linear-H",
      "label": "Underlying Array  (index = hash(key) % size)",
      "initialState": {
        "items": [
          { "id": "a0", "value": "[ ]" },
          { "id": "a1", "value": "[ ]" },
          { "id": "a2", "value": "[ ]" },
          { "id": "a3", "value": "[ ]" },
          { "id": "a4", "value": "[ ]" },
          { "id": "a5", "value": "[ ]" },
          { "id": "a6", "value": "[ ]" }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hashmap-view",
      "type": "map",
      "layoutHint": "hashmap-buckets",
      "label": "Logical View",
      "initialState": {
        "entries": []
      }
    }
  ],
  "activeText": {
    "initialValue": "Empty HashMap  (size=7, 0 entries)"
  },
  "hud": [
    {
      "id": "load-factor",
      "label": "Load Factor",
      "initialValue": 0
    }
  ],
  "controls": [
    {
      "id": "btn-put",
      "type": "button",
      "label": "put('name','Alice')",
      "config": {
        "variant": "primary",
        "goToStep": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "btn-collision",
      "type": "button",
      "label": "Trigger Collision",
      "config": {
        "variant": "destructive",
        "goToStep": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "btn-get",
      "type": "button",
      "label": "get('name') → hit",
      "config": {
        "variant": "secondary",
        "goToStep": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "btn-resize",
      "type": "button",
      "label": "Trigger Resize",
      "config": {
        "variant": "destructive",
        "goToStep": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "btn-remove",
      "type": "button",
      "label": "remove('city')",
      "config": {
        "variant": "destructive",
        "goToStep": 8
      }
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "explanation": {
        "heading": "Hash Function",
        "body": "A good hash function:\n- Distributes keys **uniformly** across buckets\n- Is **fast** to compute (O(1))\n- Produces the **same index** for equal keys\n\nJava's `hashCode()` and Python's `hash()` XOR the bits of the key representation.",
        "callout": "Bad hash function → all keys land in same bucket → O(n) performance."
      },
      "activeText": "put('name','Alice')  →  hash('name') % 7 = 5  →  bucket[5]",
      "hud": {
        "load-factor": 14
      },
      "canvas": {
        "bucket-array": {
          "items": [
            { "id": "a0", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "a1", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "a2", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "a3", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "a4", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "a5", "value": "[name]", "highlight": "insert" },
            { "id": "a6", "value": "[ ]" }
          ]
        },
        "hashmap-view": {
          "entries": [
            {
              "id": "entry-name",
              "key": "name",
              "value": "Alice",
              "highlight": "insert"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "explanation": {
        "heading": "Step 2",
        "body": "State updated."
      },
      "activeText": "put('age', 30)  →  hash('age') % 7 = 1  →  bucket[1]",
      "hud": {
        "load-factor": 29
      },
      "canvas": {
        "bucket-array": {
          "items": [
            { "id": "a0", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "a1", "value": "[age]", "highlight": "insert" },
            { "id": "a2", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "a3", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "a4", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "a5", "value": "[name]" },
            { "id": "a6", "value": "[ ]" }
          ]
        },
        "hashmap-view": {
          "entries": [
            {
              "id": "entry-name",
              "key": "name",
              "value": "Alice"
            },
            {
              "id": "entry-age",
              "key": "age",
              "value": "30",
              "highlight": "insert"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "explanation": {
        "heading": "Collision → Chaining",
        "body": "Two different keys can hash to the same bucket — this is a **collision**.\n\n**Chaining**: each bucket holds a **linked list** of all entries that map there.\n\nLookup: hash(key) → find bucket → scan the chain for matching key.\n\nAverage case: O(1) if load factor is low."
      },
      "activeText": "put('city','NYC')  →  hash('city') % 7 = 5  →  COLLISION! Same bucket as 'name'",
      "hud": {
        "load-factor": 43
      },
      "canvas": {
        "bucket-array": {
          "items": [
            { "id": "a0", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "a1", "value": "[age]" },
            { "id": "a2", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "a3", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "a4", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "a5", "value": "[name→city]", "highlight": "active" },
            { "id": "a6", "value": "[ ]" }
          ]
        },
        "hashmap-view": {
          "entries": [
            {
              "id": "entry-name",
              "key": "name",
              "value": "Alice"
            },
            {
              "id": "entry-age",
              "key": "age",
              "value": "30"
            },
            {
              "id": "entry-city",
              "key": "city",
              "value": "NYC",
              "highlight": "insert"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "explanation": {
        "heading": "Step 4",
        "body": "State updated."
      },
      "activeText": "Chaining: bucket[5] is a linked list  →  name→Alice → city→NYC",
      "canvas": {
        "bucket-array": {
          "items": [
            { "id": "a0", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "a1", "value": "[age]" },
            { "id": "a2", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "a3", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "a4", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "a5", "value": "[name→city]", "highlight": "active" },
            { "id": "a6", "value": "[ ]" }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "explanation": {
        "heading": "Step 5",
        "body": "State updated."
      },
      "activeText": "get('name')  →  hash=5  →  scan bucket[5] list  →  found!  O(1) avg",
      "canvas": {
        "bucket-array": {
          "items": [
            { "id": "a0", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "a1", "value": "[age]" },
            { "id": "a2", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "a3", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "a4", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "a5", "value": "[name→city]", "highlight": "hit" },
            { "id": "a6", "value": "[ ]" }
          ]
        },
        "hashmap-view": {
          "entries": [
            {
              "id": "entry-name",
              "key": "name",
              "value": "Alice",
              "highlight": "hit"
            },
            {
              "id": "entry-age",
              "key": "age",
              "value": "30"
            },
            {
              "id": "entry-city",
              "key": "city",
              "value": "NYC"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "explanation": {
        "heading": "Load Factor & Resizing",
        "body": "Load factor = `entries / bucket_count`.\n\nWhen load factor exceeds **0.75** (threshold used by Java's HashMap):\n1. Allocate a new array 2× the size\n2. **Rehash** all entries into new buckets\n\nThis keeps average chain length close to 1, maintaining O(1) lookups.",
        "callout": "Resize is O(n), but amortized over n insertions it's still O(1) average per put()."
      },
      "activeText": "put() more keys…  →  load factor approaching 0.75  →  trigger RESIZE!",
      "hud": {
        "load-factor": 71
      },
      "canvas": {
        "bucket-array": {
          "items": [
            { "id": "a0", "value": "[e]" },
            { "id": "a1", "value": "[age→f]" },
            { "id": "a2", "value": "[g]" },
            { "id": "a3", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "a4", "value": "[h]" },
            { "id": "a5", "value": "[name→city]" },
            { "id": "a6", "value": "[i]" }
          ]
        },
        "hashmap-view": {
          "entries": [
            {
              "id": "entry-name",
              "key": "name",
              "value": "Alice"
            },
            {
              "id": "entry-age",
              "key": "age",
              "value": "30"
            },
            {
              "id": "entry-city",
              "key": "city",
              "value": "NYC"
            },
            {
              "id": "entry-email",
              "key": "email",
              "value": "a@b.c"
            },
            {
              "id": "entry-role",
              "key": "role",
              "value": "admin"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "explanation": {
        "heading": "Step 7",
        "body": "State updated."
      },
      "activeText": "Resize!  →  double array size (7→14)  →  rehash all keys  →  new distribution",
      "hud": {
        "load-factor": 36
      },
      "canvas": {
        "bucket-array": {
          "items": [
            { "id": "b0", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "b1", "value": "[age]", "highlight": "insert" },
            { "id": "b2", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "b3", "value": "[city]", "highlight": "insert" },
            { "id": "b4", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "b5", "value": "[name]", "highlight": "insert" },
            { "id": "b6", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "b7", "value": "[email]", "highlight": "insert" },
            { "id": "b8", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "b9", "value": "[role]", "highlight": "insert" },
            { "id": "b10", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "b11", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "b12", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "b13", "value": "[ ]" }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "explanation": {
        "heading": "Step 8",
        "body": "State updated."
      },
      "activeText": "remove('city')  →  hash=3 in new array  →  unlink from bucket chain",
      "hud": {
        "load-factor": 29
      },
      "canvas": {
        "bucket-array": {
          "items": [
            { "id": "b0", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "b1", "value": "[age]" },
            { "id": "b2", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "b3", "value": "[city]", "highlight": "error" },
            { "id": "b4", "value": "[ ]" },
            { "id": "b5", "value": "[name]" },
            { "id": "b6", "value": "[ ]" },
